                                                   rdfs:subClassOf <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001213> ;
                                                   rdfs:label "Deactivated Stasis"@en ;
                                                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Stasis of Artifact Operationality that holds during a Temporal Interval when an Artifact is not realizing any of its designed Artifact Functions (or at least not realizing any of its primary functions)."@en ;
                                                   <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/EventOntology"^^xsd:anyURI .


###  https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000952
